        "text_3HRgAN": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>In 2010, <a href=\"https://weststreetliquorcompany.com/\" target=\"_blank\">West Street Liquor Company (WLC)</a> emerged under the umbrella of Aruba Trading Company, a fixture in the community since 1923. They quickly made significant strides, reaching a pinnacle in 2018 by introducing a dozen tantalizing new flavors of rum and spirits.</p><p>During this growth spurt, a question arose: how to label the myriad of new products efficiently and effectively. The solution, it turns out, lay just across the Atlantic at the doorstep of NADCO Tapes and Labels.</p><h2><strong>Challenge</strong></h2><p>Cost-efficiently transition from hand labeling to automation without losing label quality or flexibility in design, material, and finishes.</p><h2><strong>Solution</strong></h2><p>Implement onsite machines for applying custom digitally printed labels.</p><h2><strong>Throughput</strong></h2><p>Label design/production process is now seamless, with shorter lead times, consistent quality, and competitive prices.</p>",
            "subtext_color": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_3HRgAN"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.image-with-text.name",
      "settings": {
        "container": "fixed",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/west-street-liquor-500x364_png.webp",
        "image_position": "left",
        "image_width": 50,
        "desktop_content_position": "center",
        "desktop_content_alignment": "left",
        "mobile_content_alignment": "inherit",
        "show_section_divider": false,
        "divider_width": "fixed",
