    "rich_text_bRFfMa": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_gEphyK": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>Solution</strong>",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_yhTjd8": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Recognizing WLC’s diverse labeling needs and budgetary concerns, NADCO devised a personalized solution. By providing credits over multiple years for each printing tool purchased, they set up cost-efficient production for the variety of shapes and sizes of labels with different materials and cuts.</p><p>Moreover, NADCO provided flexibility in accommodating varying order quantities, reflecting their commitment to supporting WLC’s evolving product lineup.</p><p>“The implementation process was seamless with NADCO,” said Carla Kok, Marketing Manager. “To ensure everything would go as planned, they even provided sample labels for testing so compatibility issues with our products and processes wouldn’t be a problem.”</p>",
            "text_size": "text-base",
            "text_line_limit": "none",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
            "button_icon": "none"
          }
        }
      },
