      "blocks": {
        "heading_fPVYaj": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>Results</strong>",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_F3BWwa": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The reliable production ensured a quick turnaround and reduced downtime in WLC’s bottling process. The financial incentives uniquely tailored to their business not only benefited their bottom line but also fostered growth.</p><p>Additionally, NADCO’s proactive communication and meticulous attention to detail streamlined the artwork approval process, with new orders progressing from placement to production swiftly.</p><p>“Because of their consistent label quality and reliable shipping,” said Sacher. “NADCO has become our primary label supplier.”</p>",
            "text_size": "text-base",
            "text_line_limit": "none",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
            "button_icon": "none"
          }
        }
