      "blocks": {
        "heading_RYw34k": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The spirit of expansion continues",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_YkMDnE": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Sacher noted that for WLC, NADCO’s significance extends beyond expertise and material variety. Their adaptability to quickly respond to an ever-changing business and prioritize an ongoing, trustworthy partnership is invaluable.</p><p>It’s a relationship that has been pivotal in WLC’s expansion across North America and one that has helped keep their confidence in further market growth. With a growing presence in numerous U.S. resorts and casinos, WLC has expanded to offer over 50 spirits and liqueurs.</p><p>“NADCO is our cornerstone label partner for this region,” said Sacher. “They’ve been instrumental in navigating our growth over the past seven years and beyond. Without a doubt, we trust them to continue supporting us in the future.”</p>",
            "text_size": "text-base",
            "text_line_limit": "none",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
            "button_icon": "none"
          }
        }
